        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Reviews all store performance, identifies future closure candidates, evaluates new opportunities in vacated areas; FP&amp;A models scenarios; optimal network plan to Executive Committee
Responsible (R): VP Store Operations / FP&amp;A Director
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: 5–10 days + 3–5 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2284_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2284_Flow9</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
